            "review_title": "Review at Original Bar Saigon",
            "review_text": "Diana B\n20 contributions\n0\nSuper little bar\nMay 2024 • Family\nBrilliant little cocktail bar tucked down a side street not far from walking street of bu vien. The cocktails are really creative and there was a sensory theme - I chose ‘sight’ and it was a real visual delight before I even tasted it. Definitely worth a visit. The staff are really friendly and the atmosphere is great. \n(They also have beers)\nInsider tip:\nWe didn’t have food\nValue\nService\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 6, 2024",
